tamp\" data-timestamp=\"16972.332443\">4:42:52</span>  **325.** najhānapaccayā ārammaṇe ekaṃ, anantare ekaṃ, samanantare ekaṃ, sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, upanissaye ekaṃ, purejāte ekaṃ, kamme ekaṃ, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre ekaṃ, indriye ekaṃ, sampayutte ekaṃ, vippayutte ekaṃ, atthiyā ekaṃ, natthiyā ekaṃ, vigate ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>### catukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17016.39037\">4:43:36</span>  najhānapaccayā nahetupaccayā naārammaṇapaccayā sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, kamme ekaṃ, āhāre ekaṃ, indriye ekaṃ, atthiyā ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### namaggadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17052.970459\">4:44:12</span>  **326.** namaggapaccayā ārammaṇe ekaṃ, anantare ekaṃ, samanantare ekaṃ, sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, upanissaye ekaṃ, purejāte ekaṃ, āsevane ekaṃ, kamme ekaṃ, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre ekaṃ, indriye ekaṃ, jhāne ekaṃ, sampayutte ekaṃ, vippayutte ekaṃ, atthiyā ekaṃ, natthiyā ekaṃ, vigate ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>### catukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17101.188951\">4:45:01</span> namaggapaccayā nahetupaccayā naārammaṇapaccayā sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, kamme ekaṃ, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre ekaṃ, indriye ekaṃ, jhāne ekaṃ, vippayutte ekaṃ, atthiyā ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### nasampayuttadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17146.340797\">4:45:46</span>   **327.** nasampayuttapaccayā hetuyā pañca, adhipatiyā pañca, sahajāte pañca, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye pañca, kamme pañca, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre pañca, indriye pañca, jhāne pañca, magge pañca, vippayutte pañca, atthiyā pañca, avigate pañca।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17180.438422\">4:46:20</span>  nasampayuttapaccayā nahetupaccayā sahajāte ekaṃ…pe॰… avigate ekaṃ। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### navippayuttadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17206.185043\">4:46:46</span> **328.** navippayuttapaccayā hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā tīṇi, anantare tīṇi, samanantare tīṇi, sahajāte tīṇi, aññamaññe tīṇi, nissaye tīṇi, upanissaye tīṇi, āsevane tīṇi, kamme tīṇi, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre tīṇi, indriye tīṇi, jhāne tīṇi, magge tīṇi, sampayutte tīṇi, atthiyā tīṇi, natthiyā tīṇi, vigate tīṇi, avigate tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17253.966903\">4:47:33</span> navippayuttapaccayā nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe dve, anantare dve, samanantare dve, sahajāte dve, aññamaññe dve, nissaye dve, upanissaye dve, āsevane ekaṃ kamme dve, āhāre dve, indriye dve, jhāne dve, magge ekaṃ, sampayutte dve, atthiyā dve, natthiyā dve, vigate dve, avigate dve।</p><p><br /></p><p>### catukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17294.085381\">4:48:14</span>  navippayuttapaccayā nahetupaccayā naārammaṇapaccayā sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, kamme ekaṃ, āhāre ekaṃ, indriye ekaṃ, atthiyā ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17315.427457\">4:48:35</span> nonatthipaccayā… novigatapaccayā (naārammaṇapaccayasadisaṃ)।</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17339.689535\">4:48:59</span> &gt; *paccayavāre paccanīyānulomaṃ।*</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17347.070726\">4:49:07</span>   &gt; *paccayavāro।*</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17356.368153\">4:49:16</span> ### 4:nissayavāro</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17362.154739\">4:49:22</span>   ### 1:paccayānulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p> ### 1:vibhaṅgavāro</p><p><br /></p><p>### hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17368.062867\">4:49:28</span> **329.** kusalaṃ dhammaṃ nissāya kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā – kusalaṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ nissāya tayo khandhā, tayo khandhe nissāya eko khandho, dve khandhe nissāya dve khandhā। kusalaṃ dhammaṃ nissāya abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā – kusale khandhe nissāya cittasamuṭṭhānaṃ rūpaṃ। kusalaṃ dhammaṃ nissāya kusalo ca abyākato ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā। kusalaṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ nissāya tayo khandhā cittasamuṭṭhānañca rūpaṃ, tayo khandhe nissāya eko khandho cittasamuṭṭhānañca rūpaṃ, dve khandhe nissāya dve khandhā cittasamuṭṭhānañca rūpaṃ। (3)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17437.120176\">4:50:37</span>  **330.** akusalaṃ dhammaṃ nissāya akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā – akusalaṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ nissāya tayo khandhā…pe॰… dve khandhe nissāya dve khandhā। akusalaṃ dhammaṃ nissāya abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā – akusale khandhe nissāya cittasamuṭṭhānaṃ rūpaṃ। akusalaṃ dhammaṃ nissāya akusalo ca abyākato ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā – akusalaṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ nissāya tayo khandhā cittasamuṭṭhānañca rūpaṃ…pe॰… dve khandhe nissāya dve khandhā cittasamuṭṭhānañca rūpaṃ। (3)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17497.219909\">4:51:37</span>  **331.** abyākataṃ dhammaṃ nissāya abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā – vipākābyākataṃ kiriyābyākataṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ nissāya tayo khandhā cittasamuṭṭhānañca rūpaṃ, tayo khandhe nissāya eko khandho cittasamuṭṭhānañca rūpaṃ, dve khandhe nissāya dve khandhā cittasamuṭṭhānañca rūpaṃ; paṭisandhikkhaṇe vipākābyākataṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ nissāya tayo khandhā kaṭattā ca rūpaṃ, tayo khandhe nissāya eko khandho kaṭattā ca rūpaṃ, dve khandhe nissāya dve khandhā kaṭattā ca rūpaṃ; khandhe nissāya vatthu, vatthuṃ nissāya khandhā; ekaṃ mahābhūtaṃ nissāya tayo mahābhūtā, tayo mahābhūte nissāya ekaṃ mahābhūtaṃ, dve mahābhūte nissāya dve mahābhūtā, mahābhūte nissāya cittasamuṭṭhānaṃ rūpaṃ kaṭattārūpaṃ upādārūpaṃ; vatthuṃ nissāya vipākābyākatā kiriyābyākatā khandhā। (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17589.991854\">4:53:09</span> abyākataṃ dhammaṃ nissāya kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā – vatthuṃ nissāya kusalā khandhā। (2)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17605.128738\">4:53:25</span> abyākataṃ dhammaṃ nissāya akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā – vatthuṃ nissāya akusalā khandhā। (3)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17620.229124\">4:53:40</span> abyākataṃ dhammaṃ nissāya kusalo ca abyākato ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā – vatthuṃ nissāya kusalā khandhā, mahābhūte nissāya cittasamuṭṭhānaṃ rūpaṃ। (4)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17640.374047\">4:54:00</span>  abyākataṃ dhammaṃ nissāya akusalo ca abyākato ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā – vatthuṃ nissāya akusalā khandhā, mahābhūte nissāya cittasamuṭṭhānaṃ rūpaṃ। (5)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17662.186545\">4:54:22</span> **332.** kusalañca abyākatañca dhammaṃ nissāya kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā – kusalaṃ ekaṃ khandhañca vatthuñca nissāya tayo khandhā…pe॰… dve khandhe ca vatthuñca nissāya dve khandhā। kusalañca abyākatañca dhammaṃ nissāya abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā – kusale khandhe ca mahābhūte ca nissāya cittasamuṭṭhānaṃ rūpaṃ। kusalañca abyākatañca dhammaṃ nissāya kusalo ca abyākato ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā – kusalaṃ ekaṃ khandhañca vatthuñca nissāya tayo khandhā…pe॰… dve khandhe ca vatthuñca nissāya dve khandhā, kusale khandhe ca mahābhūte ca nissāya cittasamuṭṭhānaṃ rūpaṃ। (3)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17733.301911\">4:55:33</span> akusalañca abyākatañca dhammaṃ nissāya akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā – akusalaṃ ekaṃ khandhañca vatthuñca nissāya tayo khandhā …pe॰… dve khandhe ca vatthuñca nissāya dve khandhā। akusalañca abyākatañca dhammaṃ nissāya abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā – akusale khandhe ca mahābhūte ca nissāya cittasamuṭṭhānaṃ rūpaṃ। akusalañca abyākatañca dhammaṃ nissāya akusalo ca abyākato ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā – akusalaṃ ekaṃ khandhañca vatthuñca nissāya tayo khandhā…pe॰… dve khandhe ca vatthuñca nissāya dve khandhā, akusale khandhe ca mahābhūte ca nissāya cittasamuṭṭhānaṃ rūpaṃ। (3)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17802.185725\">4:56:42</span> (yathā paccayavāre, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### 1:paccayānulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>### 2:saṅkhyāvāro</p><p><br /></p><p>### suddhaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17811.482191\">4:56:51</span>  **333.** hetuyā sattarasa, ārammaṇe satta, adhipatiyā sattarasa, anantare satta, samanantare satta, sahajāte sattarasa, aññamaññe satta, nissaye sattarasa, upanissaye satta, purejāte satta, āsevane satta, kamme sattarasa, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre sattarasa, indriye sattarasa, jhāne sattarasa, magge sattarasa, sampayutte satta, vippayutte sattarasa, atthiyā sattarasa, natthiyā satta, vigate satta, avigate sattarasa।</p><p><br /></p><p>(yathā paccayavāre, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17867.018275\">4:57:47</span> &gt; *nissayavāre anulomaṃ।*</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17874.510847\">4:57:54</span> ### 2:paccayapaccanīyaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>### 1:vibhaṅgavāro</p><p><br /></p><p>### nahetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17881.265739\">4:58:01</span> **334.** akusalaṃ dhammaṃ nissāya akusalo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā – vicikicchāsahagate uddhaccasahagate khandhe nissāya vicikicchāsahagato uddhaccasahagato moho। (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"17902.089053\">4:58:22</span>  abyākataṃ dhammaṃ nissāya abyākato dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā – ahetukaṃ vipākābyākataṃ kiriyābyākataṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ nissāya tayo khandhā cittasamuṭṭhānañca rūpaṃ, tayo khandhe nissāya eko khandho cittasamuṭṭhānañca rūpaṃ, dve khandha nissāya dve khandhā cittasamuṭṭhānañca rūpaṃ; ahetukapaṭisandhikkhaṇe vipākābyākataṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ nissāya tayo khandhā kaṭattā ca rūpaṃ…pe॰… dve khandhe nissāya dve khandhā kaṭattā ca rūpaṃ; khandhe nissāya vatthu, vatthuṃ nissāya khandhā; ekaṃ mahābhūtaṃ nissāya tayo mahābhūtā…pe॰… mahābhūte nissāya cittasamuṭṭhānaṃ rūpaṃ kaṭattārūpaṃ upādārūpaṃ; bāhiraṃ… āhārasamuṭṭhānaṃ… utusamuṭṭhānaṃ… asaññasattānaṃ ekaṃ mahābhūtaṃ nissāya tayo mahābhūtā…pe॰… mahābhūte nissāya kaṭattārūpaṃ upādārūpaṃ; cakkhāyatanaṃ nissāya cakkhuviññāṇaṃ…pe॰… kāyāyatanaṃ nissāya kāyaviññāṇaṃ; vatthuṃ nissāya ahetukā vipākābyākatā kiriyābyākatā khandhā। (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18025.960695\">5:00:25</span>  abyākataṃ dhammaṃ nissāya akusalo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā – vatthuṃ nissāya vicikicchāsahagato uddhaccasahagato moho। (2)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18043.821608\">5:00:43</span>  akusalañca abyākatañca dhammaṃ nissāya akusalo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā – vicikicchāsahagate uddhaccasahagate khandhe ca vatthuñca nissāya vicikicchāsahagato uddhaccasahagato moho। (1)</p><p><br /></p><p> (yathā paccayavāre, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### 2:paccayapaccanīyaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>### 2:saṅkhyāvāro</p><p><br /></p><p>### suddhaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18073.237513\">5:01:13</span> **335.** nahetuyā cattāri, naārammaṇe pañca, naadhipatiyā sattarasa, naanantare pañca, nasamanantare pañca, naaññamaññe pañca, naupanissaye pañca, napurejāte satta, napacchājāte sattarasa, naāsevane sattarasa, nakamme satta, navipāke sattarasa, naāhāre ekaṃ, naindriye ekaṃ, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, nasampayutte pañca, navippayutte tīṇi, nonatthiyā pañca, novigate pañca।</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18120.654096\">5:02:00</span>  &gt; *nissayavāre paccanīyaṃ।*</p><p><br /></p><p> ### 3:paccayānulomapaccanīyaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>### hetudukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18127.890929\">5:02:07</span>   *336.** hetupaccayā naārammaṇe pañca, naadhipatiyā sattarasa, naanantare pañca, nasamanantare pañca, naaññamaññe pañca, naupanissaye pañca, napurejāte satta, napacchājāte sattarasa, naāsevane sattarasa, nakamme satta, navipāke sattarasa, nasampayutte pañca, navippayutte tīṇi, nonatthiyā pañca, novigate pañca। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18168.078283\">5:02:48</span>  &gt; *nissayavāre anulomapaccanīyaṃ।*</p><p><br /></p><p> ### 4:paccayapaccanīyānulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>### nahetudukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18178.062454\">5:02:58</span> **337.** nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe cattāri, anantare cattāri, samanantare cattāri, sahajāte cattāri, aññamaññe cattāri, nissaye cattāri, upanissaye cattāri, purejāte cattāri, āsevane cattāri, kamme cattāri, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre cattāri, indriye cattāri, jhāne cattāri, magge tīṇi, sampayutte cattāri, vippayutte cattāri, atthiyā cattāri, natthiyā cattāri, vigate cattāri, avigate cattāri। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18227.735528\">5:03:47</span>  &gt; *nissayavāre paccanīyānulomaṃ।*</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18235.055625\">5:03:55</span> (paccayattaṃ nāma nissayattaṃ, nissayattaṃ nāma paccayattaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18245.443914\">5:04:05</span>  &gt; *nissayavāro।*</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18252.310234\">5:04:12</span>  ### 5:saṃsaṭṭhavāro</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18259.817421\">5:04:19</span>   ### 1:paccayānulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>### 1:vibhaṅgavāro</p><p><br /></p><p>### hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18266.085162\">5:04:26</span>  **338.** kusalaṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā – kusalaṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ saṃsaṭṭhā tayo khandhā, tayo khandhe saṃsaṭṭho eko khandho, dve khandhe saṃsaṭṭhā dve khandhā। (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18287.999461\">5:04:47</span>  akusalaṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā – akusalaṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ saṃsaṭṭhā tayo khandhā, tayo khandhe saṃsaṭṭho eko khandho, dve khandhe saṃsaṭṭhā dve khandhā। (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18311.282128\">5:05:11</span> abyākataṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā – vipākābyākataṃ kiriyābyākataṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ saṃsaṭṭhā tayo khandhā, tayo khandhe saṃsaṭṭho eko khandho, dve khandhe saṃsaṭṭhā dve khandhā; paṭisandhikkhaṇe vipākābyākataṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ saṃsaṭṭhā tayo khandhā, tayo khandhe saṃsaṭṭho eko khandho, dve khandhe saṃsaṭṭhā dve khandhā। (1)</p><p><br /></p><p> ### ārammaṇādipaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18361.206709\">5:06:01</span>  **339.** kusalaṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho kusalo dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā… adhipatipaccayā… (adhipati paṭisandhikkhaṇe natthi।) anantarapaccayā… samanantarapaccayā… sahajātapaccayā… aññamaññapaccayā… nissayapaccayā… upanissayapaccayā। (sabbāni padāni hetumūlakasadisāni)।</p><p><br /></p><p>### purejātapaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18403.575196\">5:06:43</span>  **340.** kusalaṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho kusalo dhammo uppajjati purejātapaccayā – kusalaṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ saṃsaṭṭhā tayo khandhā, tayo khandhe saṃsaṭṭho eko khandho, dve khandhe saṃsaṭṭhā dve khandhā, vatthuṃ purejātapaccayā। (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18431.199845\">5:07:11</span> akusalaṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho akusalo dhammo uppajjati purejātapaccayā – akusalaṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ saṃsaṭṭhā tayo khandhā, tayo khandhe saṃsaṭṭho eko khandho, dve khandhe saṃsaṭṭhā dve khandhā; vatthuṃ purejātapaccayā। (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18458.604541\">5:07:38</span>  abyākataṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho abyākato dhammo uppajjati purejātapaccayā – vipākābyākataṃ kiriyābyākataṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ saṃsaṭṭhā tayo khandhā, tayo khandhe saṃsaṭṭho eko khandho, dve khandhe saṃsaṭṭhā dve khandhā; vatthuṃ purejātapaccayā। (1)</p><p><br /></p><p>### āsevanapaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18497.457771\">5:08:17</span>  **341.** kusalaṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho…pe॰… akusalaṃ dhammaṃ…pe॰… abyākataṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho abyākato dhammo uppajjati āsevanapaccayā – kiriyābyākataṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ saṃsaṭṭhā…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>### kammapaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18525.595181\">5:08:45</span>   **342.** kusalaṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho kusalo dhammo uppajjati kammapaccayā…pe॰… akusalaṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho…pe॰… abyākataṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>### vipākapaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18548.986256\">5:09:08</span>   **343.** abyākataṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho abyākato dhammo uppajjati vipākapaccayā – vipākābyākataṃ…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>  ### āhārādipaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18570.370905\">5:09:30</span> **344.** kusalaṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho kusalo dhammo uppajjati āhārapaccayā… indriyapaccayā … jhānapaccayā… maggapaccayā… sampayuttapaccayā। (imāni padāni hetupaccayasadisāni।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### vippayuttapaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18598.788431\">5:09:58</span> **345.** kusalaṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho kusalo dhammo uppajjati vippayuttapaccayā – kusalaṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ saṃsaṭṭhā tayo khandhā…pe॰… dve khandhe saṃsaṭṭhā dve khandhā; vatthuṃ vippayuttapaccayā।</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18619.337296\">5:10:19</span> akusalaṃ dhammaṃ…pe॰… vatthuṃ vippayuttapaccayā।</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18625.180424\">5:10:25</span> abyākataṃ dhammaṃ…pe॰… vatthuṃ vippayuttapaccayā।</p><p><br /></p><p> ### atthiādipaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18642.13183\">5:10:42</span>  **346.** kusalaṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho kusalo dhammo uppajjati atthipaccayā… natthipaccayā… vigatapaccayā… avigatapaccayā (hetupaccayasadisaṃ)।</p><p><br /></p><p>### 1:paccayānulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>### 2:saṅkhyāvāro</p><p><br /></p><p>### suddhaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18673.114985\">5:11:13</span> **347.** hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā tīṇi, anantare tīṇi, samanantare tīṇi, sahajāte tīṇi, aññamaññe tīṇi, nissaye tīṇi, upanissaye tīṇi, purejāte tīṇi, āsevane tīṇi, kamme tīṇi, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre tīṇi, indriye tīṇi, jhāne tīṇi, magge tīṇi, sampayutte tīṇi, vippayutte tīṇi, atthiyā tīṇi, natthiyā tīṇi, vigate tīṇi, avigate tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### hetudukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18721.721844\">5:12:01</span>  **348.** hetupaccayā ārammaṇe tīṇi। (hetumūlakaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### āsevanadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18736.27765\">5:12:16</span> **349.** āsevanapaccayā hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā tīṇi, anantare tīṇi, samanantare tīṇi, sahajāte tīṇi, aññamaññe tīṇi, nissaye tīṇi, upanissaye tīṇi, purejāte tīṇi, kamme tīṇi, āhāre tīṇi, indriye tīṇi, jhāne tīṇi, magge tīṇi, sampayutte tīṇi, vippayutte tīṇi, atthiyā tīṇi, natthiyā tīṇi, vigate tīṇi, avigate tīṇi। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### vipākadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18789.214116\">5:13:09</span>   **350.** vipākapaccayā hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ, adhipatiyā ekaṃ, anantare ekaṃ, samanantare ekaṃ, sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, upanissaye ekaṃ, purejāte ekaṃ, kamme ekaṃ, āhāre ekaṃ, indriye ekaṃ, jhāne ekaṃ, magge ekaṃ, sampayutte ekaṃ, vippayutte ekaṃ, atthiyā ekaṃ, natthiyā ekaṃ, vigate ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18846.228416\">5:14:06</span> &gt; *saṃsaṭṭhavāre anulomaṃ।*</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18851.493455\">5:14:11</span> ### 2:paccayapaccanīyaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>  ### 1:vibhaṅgavāro</p><p><br /></p><p>### nahetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18858.051511\">5:14:18</span>  **351.** akusalaṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho akusalo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā – vicikicchāsahagate uddhaccasahagate khandhe saṃsaṭṭho vicikicchāsahagato uddhaccasahagato moho। (1)</p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18880.438135\">5:14:40</span>  </span><span>abyākataṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho abyākato dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā – ahetukaṃ vipākābyākataṃ kiriyābyākataṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ saṃsaṭṭhā tayo khandhā, tayo khandhe saṃsaṭṭho eko khandho, dve khandhe saṃsaṭṭhā dve khandhā; ahetukapaṭisandhikkhaṇe vipākābyākataṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ saṃsaṭṭhā tayo khandhā, tayo khandhe saṃsaṭṭho eko khandho, dve khandhe saṃsaṭṭhā dve khandhā। (1)</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18926.249951\">5:15:26</span> ### naadhipatiādipaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18933.140405\">5:15:33</span> **352.** kusalaṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho kusalo dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā… napurejātapaccayā – arūpe kusalaṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ saṃsaṭṭhā tayo khandhā…pe॰… dve khandhe saṃsaṭṭhā dve khandhā। akusalaṃ dhammaṃ…pe॰… abyākataṃ dhammaṃ…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>### napacchājāta-naāsevanapaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18964.060679\">5:16:04</span> **353.** kusalaṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho kusalo dhammo uppajjati napacchājātapaccayā… tīṇi। naāsevanapaccayā… tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p> ### nakammapaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"18986.752555\">5:16:26</span> **354.** kusalaṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho kusalo dhammo uppajjati nakammapaccayā। kusale khandhe saṃsaṭṭhā kusalā cetanā। (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19001.52106\">5:16:41</span>  akusalaṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho akusalo dhammo uppajjati nakammapaccayā। akusale khandhe saṃsaṭṭhā akusalā cetanā। (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19017.230644\">5:16:57</span>  abyākataṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho abyākato dhammo uppajjati nakammapaccayā। kiriyābyākate khandhe saṃsaṭṭhā kiriyābyākatā cetanā। (1)</p><p><br /></p><p>### navipākapaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19043.358829\">5:17:23</span> **355.** kusalaṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho…pe॰… akusalaṃ dhammaṃ…pe॰… abyākataṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho abyākato dhammo uppajjati navipākapaccayā – kiriyābyākataṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ।</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19064.241486\">5:17:44</span>  (saṃsaṭṭhavāre paccanīyavibhaṅge nakamme ca navipāke ca paṭisandhi natthi; avasesesu sabbattha atthi।)</p><p><br /></p><p> ### najhānapaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19086.085724\">5:18:06</span>  **356.** abyākataṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho abyākato dhammo uppajjati najhānapaccayā – pañcaviññāṇasahagataṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ saṃsaṭṭhā tayo khandhā…pe॰… dve khandhe saṃsaṭṭhā dve khandhā। (1)</p><p><br /></p><p>### namaggapaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19115.192615\">5:18:35</span> **357.** abyākataṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho abyākato dhammo uppajjati namaggapaccayā – ahetukaṃ vipākābyākataṃ kiriyābyākataṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ saṃsaṭṭhā tayo khandhā…pe॰… dve khandhe saṃsaṭṭhā dve khandhā; ahetukapaṭisandhikkhaṇe…pe॰…। (1)</p><p><br /></p><p>### navippayuttapaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19149.025079\">5:19:09</span> **358.** kusalaṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho kusalo dhammo uppajjati navippayuttapaccayā – arūpe kusalaṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ saṃsaṭṭhā tayo khandhā…pe॰… dve khandhe saṃsaṭṭhā dve khandhā। (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19170.110709\">5:19:30</span>  akusalaṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho akusalo dhammo uppajjati navippayuttapaccayā – arūpe akusalaṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ saṃsaṭṭhā tayo khandhā…pe॰… dve khandhe saṃsaṭṭhā dve khandhā। (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19192.080126\">5:19:52</span>  abyākataṃ dhammaṃ saṃsaṭṭho abyākato dhammo uppajjati navippayuttapaccayā – arūpe vipākābyākataṃ kiriyābyākataṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ saṃsaṭṭhā tayo khandhā…pe॰… dve khandhe saṃsaṭṭhā dve khandhā। (navippayutte paṭisandhi natthi।) (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19232.030079\">5:20:32</span>  ### 2:paccayapaccanīyaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p> ### 2:saṅkhyāvāro</p><p><br /></p><p>### suddhaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19238.220682\">5:20:38</span> **359.** nahetuyā dve, naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, na āsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### nahetudukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19264.429172\">5:21:04</span> **360.** nahetupaccayā naadhipatiyā dve, napurejāte dve, napacchājāte dve, naāsevane dve, nakamme ekaṃ, navipāke dve, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte dve।</p><p><br /></p><p> ### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19290.011525\">5:21:30</span>  nahetupaccayā naadhipatipaccayā napurejāte dve, napacchājāte dve, naāsevane dve, nakamme ekaṃ, navipāke dve, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte dve।</p><p><br /></p><p>### catukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19314.164191\">5:21:54</span> nahetupaccayā naadhipatipaccayā napurejātapaccayā napacchājāte dve, naāsevane dve, nakamme ekaṃ, navipāke dve, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte dve…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>### chakkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19337.346978\">5:22:17</span> nahetupaccayā naadhipatipaccayā napurejātapaccayā napacchājātapaccayā naāsevanapaccayā nakamme ekaṃ, navipāke dve, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte dve।</p><p><br /></p><p>### sattakaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19360.252115\">5:22:40</span> nahetupaccayā naadhipatipaccayā napurejātapaccayā napacchājātapaccayā naāsevanapaccayā nakammapaccayā navipāke ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte ekaṃ…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>### navakaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19384.074951\">5:23:04</span>  nahetupaccayā naadhipatipaccayā…pe॰… nakammapaccayā navipākapaccayā namaggapaccayā navippayutte ekaṃ।</p><p><br /></p><p>### naadhipatidukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19409.136456\">5:23:29</span>   **361.** naadhipatipaccayā nahetuyā dve, napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19435.058055\">5:23:55</span>  naadhipatipaccayā nahetupaccayā napurejāte dve, napacchājāte dve, naāsevane dve, nakamme ekaṃ, navipāke dve, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte dve। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### napurejātadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19466.091059\">5:24:26</span> **362.** napurejātapaccayā nahetuyā dve, naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19490.03767\">5:24:50</span> napurejātapaccayā nahetupaccayā naadhipatiyā dve, napacchājāte dve, naāsevane dve, nakamme ekaṃ, navipāke dve, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte dve। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### napacchājāta-naāsevanadukāni</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19521.17662\">5:25:21</span>  **363.** napacchājātapaccayā …pe॰… naāsevanapaccayā nahetuyā dve, naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19549.396691\">5:25:49</span> naāsevanapaccayā nahetupaccayā naadhipatiyā dve, napurejāte dve, napacchājāte dve, nakamme ekaṃ, navipāke dve, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte dve। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### nakammadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19585.069515\">5:26:25</span>  **364.** nakammapaccayā nahetuyā ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19609.0368\">5:26:49</span> nakammapaccayā nahetupaccayā naadhipatiyā ekaṃ, napurejāte ekaṃ, napacchājāte ekaṃ, naāsevane ekaṃ, navipāke ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte ekaṃ। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### navipākadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19641.343606\">5:27:21</span> **365.** navipākapaccayā nahetuyā dve, naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte tīṇi…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>### sattakaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19666.275472\">5:27:46</span>  navipākapaccayā nahetupaccayā naadhipatipaccayā napurejātapaccayā napacchājātapaccayā naāsevanapaccayā nakamme ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte dve। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### najhānadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19696.511777\">5:28:16</span>   **366.** najhānapaccayā nahetuyā ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā ekaṃ, napacchājāte ekaṃ, naāsevane ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>### chakkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19715.437837\">5:28:35</span>  najhānapaccayā nahetupaccayā naadhipatipaccayā napacchājātapaccayā naāsevanapaccayā namagge ekaṃ।</p><p><br /></p><p>### namaggadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19740.097405\">5:29:00</span>  **367.** namaggapaccayā nahetuyā ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā ekaṃ, napurejāte ekaṃ, napacchājāte ekaṃ, naāsevane ekaṃ, nakamme ekaṃ, navipāke ekaṃ, najhāne ekaṃ, navippayutte ekaṃ। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### navippayuttadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19775.327312\">5:29:35</span>  **368.** navippayuttapaccayā nahetuyā dve, naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, namagge ekaṃ।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19798.640151\">5:29:58</span>  navippayuttapaccayā nahetupaccayā naadhipatiyā dve, napurejāte dve, napacchājāte dve, naāsevane dve, nakamme ekaṃ, navipāke dve, namagge ekaṃ…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>### navakaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19821.105796\">5:30:21</span> navippayuttapaccayā nahetupaccayā naadhipatipaccayā napurejātapaccayā napacchājātapaccayā naāsevanapaccayā nakammapaccayā navipākapaccayā namagge ekaṃ।</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19845.17337\">5:30:45</span>  &gt; *paccanīyaṃ।*</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19857.081922\">5:30:57</span>   ### 3:paccayānulomapaccanīyaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>### hetudukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19865.465938\">5:31:05</span> **369.** hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, navippayutte tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19887.14634\">5:31:27</span>  hetupaccayā ārammaṇapaccayā naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, navippayutte tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### catukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19912.158467\">5:31:52</span> hetupaccayā ārammaṇapaccayā adhipatipaccayā napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, navippayutte tīṇi…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>### ekādasakaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19936.012194\">5:32:16</span>  hetupaccayā ārammaṇapaccayā adhipatipaccayā anantarapaccayā samanantarapaccayā sahajātapaccayā aññamaññapaccayā nissayapaccayā upanissayapaccayā purejātapaccayā napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### dvādasakaṃ (sāsevanaṃ)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19969.890658\">5:32:49</span>   hetupaccayā ārammaṇapaccayā…pe॰… purejātapaccayā āsevanapaccayā napacchājāte tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tevīsakaṃ (sāsevanaṃ)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"19992.071453\">5:33:12</span>  hetupaccayā ārammaṇapaccayā…pe॰… purejātapaccayā āsevanapaccayā kammapaccayā āhārapaccayā…pe॰… avigatapaccayā napacchājāte tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### terasakaṃ (savipākaṃ)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20019.25433\">5:33:39</span> hetupaccayā ārammaṇapaccayā…pe॰… purejātapaccayā kammapaccayā vipākapaccayā napacchājāte ekaṃ, naāsevane ekaṃ।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tevīsakaṃ (savipākaṃ)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20041.150956\">5:34:01</span> hetupaccayā ārammaṇapaccayā…pe॰… purejātapaccayā kammapaccayā vipākapaccayā āhārapaccayā…pe॰… avigatapaccayā napacchājāte ekaṃ, naāsevane ekaṃ।</p><p><br /></p><p>### ārammaṇadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20075.01815\">5:34:35</span>   **370.** ārammaṇapaccayā nahetuyā dve, naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte tīṇi napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20102.057452\">5:35:02</span> ārammaṇapaccayā hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā tīṇi। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### adhipatidukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20123.256121\">5:35:23</span> **371.** adhipatipaccayā napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, navippayutte tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20140.001226\">5:35:40</span>  adhipatipaccayā hetupaccayā। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### anantarādidukāni</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20144.585581\">5:35:44</span> **372.** anantarapaccayā… samanantarapaccayā… sahajātapaccayā… aññamaññapaccayā… nissayapaccayā… upanissayapaccayā।</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20155.524683\">5:35:55</span> (yathā ārammaṇamūlakaṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### purejātadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20171.998592\">5:36:11</span> **373.** purejātapaccayā nahetuyā dve, naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20195.87146\">5:36:35</span>  purejātapaccayā hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### āsevanadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20224.348866\">5:37:04</span> **374.** āsevanapaccayā nahetuyā dve, naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20247.32501\">5:37:27</span> āsevanapaccayā hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, navippayutte tīṇi। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### kammadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20278.08978\">5:37:58</span>  **375.** kammapaccayā nahetuyā dve, naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20303.844056\">5:38:23</span>  kammapaccayā hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā tīṇi। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### vipākadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20323.208307\">5:38:43</span> **376.** vipākapaccayā nahetuyā ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā ekaṃ, napurejāte ekaṃ, napacchājāte ekaṃ, naāsevane ekaṃ, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte ekaṃ।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20349.227985\">5:39:09</span> vipākapaccayā hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā ekaṃ। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### āhāradukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20369.111788\">5:39:29</span>  **377.** āhārapaccayā nahetuyā dve, naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20397.171941\">5:39:57</span> āhārapaccayā hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā tīṇi। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### indriyadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20417.144661\">5:40:17</span> **378.** indriyapaccayā nahetuyā dve, naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20444.433639\">5:40:44</span>  indriyapaccayā hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā tīṇi। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### jhānadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20463.56111\">5:41:03</span>   **379.** jhānapaccayā nahetuyā dve, naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20489.007394\">5:41:29</span>   jhānapaccayā hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā tīṇi। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### maggadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20509.154978\">5:41:49</span>  **380.** maggapaccayā nahetuyā ekaṃ, naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, navippayutte tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20532.805008\">5:42:12</span>  maggapaccayā hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā tīṇi। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### sampayuttadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20550.073828\">5:42:30</span>  **381.** sampayuttapaccayā nahetuyā dve, naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20577.27868\">5:42:57</span>  sampayuttapaccayā hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā tīṇi। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### vippayuttadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20597.676881\">5:43:17</span> **382.** vippayuttapaccayā nahetuyā dve, naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte ekaṃ, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20622.093454\">5:43:42</span>  vippayuttapaccayā hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte ekaṃ, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### catukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20644.60001\">5:44:04</span>  vippayuttapaccayā hetupaccayā ārammaṇapaccayā naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte ekaṃ, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>### dvādasakaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20667.25746\">5:44:27</span> vippayuttapaccayā hetupaccayā ārammaṇapaccayā…pe॰… purejātapaccayā napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tevīsakaṃ (sāsevanaṃ)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20702.611621\">5:45:02</span> vippayuttapaccayā hetupaccayā…pe॰… purejātapaccayā āsevanapaccayā kammapaccayā āhārapaccayā…pe॰… avigatapaccayā napacchājāte tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tevīsakaṃ (savipākaṃ)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20721.453872\">5:45:21</span> vippayuttapaccayā hetupaccayā…pe॰… purejātapaccayā kammapaccayā vipākapaccayā āhārapaccayā…pe॰… avigatapaccayā napacchājāte ekaṃ, naāsevane ekaṃ।</p><p><br /></p><p>### atthiādidukādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20741.260468\">5:45:41</span>  **383.** atthipaccayā … natthipaccayā… vigatapaccayā… avigatapaccayā…।</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20747.210152\">5:45:47</span> (yathā ārammaṇamūlakaṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20756.271744\">5:45:56</span>  &gt; *anulomapaccanīyaṃ।*</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20769.310464\">5:46:09</span>   ### 4:paccayapaccanīyānulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>### nahetudukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20776.374197\">5:46:16</span>  **384.** nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe dve, anantare dve, samanantare dve, sahajāte dve, aññamaññe dve, nissaye dve, upanissaye dve, purejāte dve, āsevane dve, kamme dve, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre dve, indriye dve, jhāne dve, magge ekaṃ, sampayutte dve, vippayutte dve, atthiyā dve, natthiyā dve, vigate dve, avigate dve।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20815.867973\">5:46:55</span>  nahetupaccayā naadhipatipaccayā ārammaṇe dve…pe॰… avigate dve, (sabbattha dve)।</p><p><br /></p><p>### catukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20832.94468\">5:47:12</span> nahetupaccayā naadhipatipaccayā napurejātapaccayā ārammaṇe dve, anantare dve, samanantare dve, sahajāte dve, aññamaññe dve, nissaye dve, upanissaye dve, āsevane ekaṃ, kamme dve, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre dve, indriye dve, jhāne dve, magge ekaṃ, sampayutte dve, vippayutte ekaṃ, atthiyā dve, natthiyā dve, vigate dve, avigate dve…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>### sattakaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20881.279699\">5:48:01</span>  nahetupaccayā naadhipatipaccayā napurejātapaccayā napacchājātapaccayā naāsevanapaccayā nakammapaccayā ārammaṇe ekaṃ, anantare ekaṃ, samanantare ekaṃ, sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, upanissaye ekaṃ, āhāre ekaṃ, indriye ekaṃ, jhāne ekaṃ, sampayutte ekaṃ, atthiyā ekaṃ, natthiyā ekaṃ, vigate ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ, (sabbattha ekaṃ)…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>### dasakaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20928.331293\">5:48:48</span> nahetupaccayā naadhipatipaccayā napurejātapaccayā napacchājātapaccayā naāsevanapaccayā nakammapaccayā navipākapaccayā namaggapaccayā navippayuttapaccayā ārammaṇe ekaṃ, anantare ekaṃ, samanantare ekaṃ, sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, upanissaye ekaṃ, āhāre ekaṃ, indriye ekaṃ, jhāne ekaṃ, sampayutte ekaṃ, atthiyā ekaṃ, natthiyā ekaṃ, vigate ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ। (navipākaṃ namaggaṃ navippayuttaṃ nakammapaccayasadisaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### naadhipatidukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"20996.294416\">5:49:56</span>  **385.** naadhipatipaccayā hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi…pe॰… avigate tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21012.450644\">5:50:12</span>  naadhipatipaccayā nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe dve…pe॰… avigate dve। (naadhipatimūlakaṃ nahetumhi ṭhitena nahetumūlakasadisaṃ kātabbaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### napurejātadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21045.80235\">5:50:45</span>  **386.** napurejātapaccayā hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi…pe॰… āsevane tīṇi, kamme tīṇi, vipāke ekaṃ।</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21070.298934\">5:51:10</span>  (sabbāni padāni vitthāretabbāni, imāni alikhitesu padesu tīṇi pañhā। napurejātamūlake nahetuyā ṭhitena āsevane ca magge ca eko pañho kātabbo, avasesāni nahetupaccayasadisāni। napacchājātapaccayā paripuṇṇaṃ naadhipatipaccayasadisaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### nakammadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21102.469688\">5:51:42</span>  **387.** nakammapaccayā hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā tīṇi, anantare tīṇi, samanantare tīṇi, sahajāte tīṇi, aññamaññe tīṇi, nissaye tīṇi, upanissaye tīṇi, purejāte tīṇi, āsevane tīṇi, āhāre tīṇi, indriye tīṇi, jhāne tīṇi, magge tīṇi, sampayutte tīṇi, vippayutte tīṇi, atthiyā tīṇi, natthiyā tīṇi, vigate tīṇi, avigate tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21146.420731\">5:52:26</span>  nakammapaccayā nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe ekaṃ, anantare ekaṃ, samanantare ekaṃ, sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, upanissaye ekaṃ, purejāte ekaṃ, āsevane ekaṃ, āhāre ekaṃ, indriye ekaṃ, jhāne ekaṃ, sampayutte ekaṃ, vippayutte ekaṃ, atthiyā ekaṃ, natthiyā ekaṃ, vigate ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>### pañcakaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21190.506835\">5:53:10</span> nakammapaccayā nahetupaccayā naadhipatipaccayā napurejātapaccayā ārammaṇe ekaṃ, anantare ekaṃ, samanantare ekaṃ, sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, upanissaye ekaṃ, āhāre ekaṃ, indriye ekaṃ, jhāne ekaṃ, sampayutte ekaṃ, atthiyā ekaṃ, natthiyā ekaṃ, vigate ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ।</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21231.075956\">5:53:51</span>   (avasesāni padāni etenupāyena vitthāretabbāni। saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p> ### navipākadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21244.19801\">5:54:04</span> **388.** navipākapaccayā hetuyā tīṇi, (saṃkhittaṃ। paripuṇṇaṃ।) avigate tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### pañcakaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21259.230656\">5:54:19</span>  navipākapaccayā nahetupaccayā naadhipatipaccayā napurejātapaccayā ārammaṇe dve, anantare dve, samanantare dve, sahajāte dve, aññamaññe dve, nissaye dve, upanissaye dve, āsevane ekaṃ, kamme dve, āhāre dve, indriye dve, jhāne dve, magge ekaṃ, sampayutte dve, atthiyā dve, natthiyā dve, vigate dve, avigate dve।</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21301.201988\">5:55:01</span> (navipākamūlake idaṃ nānākaraṇaṃ, avasesāni yathā nahetumūlakaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### najhānadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21320.321871\">5:55:20</span> **389.** najhānapaccayā ārammaṇe ekaṃ, anantare ekaṃ, samanantare ekaṃ, sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, upanissaye ekaṃ, purejāte ekaṃ, kamme ekaṃ, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre ekaṃ, indriye ekaṃ, sampayutte ekaṃ, vippayutte ekaṃ, atthiyā ekaṃ, natthiyā ekaṃ, vigate ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>### sattakaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21360.669497\">5:56:00</span>  najhānapaccayā nahetupaccayā naadhipatipaccayā napacchājātapaccayā naāsevanapaccayā namaggapaccayā ārammaṇe ekaṃ, anantare ekaṃ, samanantare ekaṃ, sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, upanissaye ekaṃ, purejāte ekaṃ, kamme ekaṃ, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre ekaṃ, indriye ekaṃ, sampayutte ekaṃ, vippayutte ekaṃ, atthiyā ekaṃ, natthiyā ekaṃ, vigate ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ।</p><p><br /></p><p>### namaggadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21417.591403\">5:56:57</span>  **390.** namaggapaccayā ārammaṇe ekaṃ, anantare ekaṃ, samanantare ekaṃ, sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, upanissaye ekaṃ, purejāte ekaṃ, āsevane ekaṃ, kamme ekaṃ, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre ekaṃ, indriye ekaṃ, jhāne ekaṃ, sampayutte ekaṃ, vippayutte ekaṃ, atthiyā ekaṃ, natthiyā ekaṃ, vigate ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>### pañcakaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21460.652938\">5:57:40</span> namaggapaccayā nahetupaccayā naadhipatipaccayā napurejātapaccayā ārammaṇe ekaṃ, anantare ekaṃ, samanantare ekaṃ, sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, upanissaye ekaṃ, kamme ekaṃ, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre ekaṃ, indriye ekaṃ, jhāne ekaṃ, sampayutte ekaṃ, vippayutte ekaṃ, atthiyā ekaṃ, natthiyā ekaṃ, vigate ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ।</p><p><br /></p><p>### chakkādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21506.622188\">5:58:26</span>  namaggapaccayā nahetupaccayā। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p>### navippayuttadukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21523.192101\">5:58:43</span>  **391.** navippayuttapaccayā hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā tīṇi, anantare tīṇi, samanantare tīṇi, sahajāte tīṇi, aññamaññe tīṇi, nissaye tīṇi, upanissaye tīṇi, āsevane tīṇi, kamme tīṇi, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre tīṇi, indriye tīṇi, jhāne tīṇi, magge tīṇi, sampayutte tīṇi, atthiyā tīṇi, natthiyā tīṇi, vigate tīṇi, avigate tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p>### tikaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21567.065968\">5:59:27</span>   navippayuttapaccayā nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe dve, anantare dve, samanantare dve, sahajāte dve, aññamaññe dve, nissaye dve, upanissaye dve, āsevane ekaṃ, kamme dve, āhāre dve, indriye dve, jhāne dve, magge ekaṃ, sampayutte dve, atthiyā dve, natthiyā dve, vigate dve, avigate dve…pe॰…।</p><p><br /></p><p>### navakaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21604.031832\">6:00:04</span> navippayuttapaccayā nahetupaccayā naadhipatipaccayā napurejātapaccayā napacchājātapaccayā (naāsevanapaccayamūlakampi nahetumūlakasadisaṃ।) nakammapaccayā navipākapaccayā namaggapaccayā (imāni tīṇi mūlāni ekasadisāni) ārammaṇe ekaṃ, anantare ekaṃ, samanantare ekaṃ, sahajāte ekaṃ, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye ekaṃ, upanissaye ekaṃ, āhāre ekaṃ, indriye ekaṃ, jhāne ekaṃ, sampayutte ekaṃ, atthiyā ekaṃ, natthiyā ekaṃ, vigate ekaṃ, avigate ekaṃ।</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21668.611829\">6:01:08</span>  &gt; *paccanīyānulomaṃ।*</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21675.65931\">6:01:15</span>  &gt; *saṃsaṭṭhavāro।*</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21684.098858\">6:01:24</span>  ### 6:sampayuttavāro</p><p><br /></p><p> ### 1:paccayānulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>### 1:vibhaṅgavāro</p><p><br /></p><p>### hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21691.156394\">6:01:31</span> **392.** kusalaṃ dhammaṃ sampayutto kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā – kusalaṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ sampayuttā tayo khandhā, tayo khandhe sampayutto eko khandho, dve khandhe sampayuttā dve khandhā। (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21714.888403\">6:01:54</span>  **393.** akusalaṃ dhammaṃ sampayutto akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā – akusalaṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ sampayuttā tayo khandhā, tayo khandhe sampayutto eko khandho, dve khandhe sampayuttā dve khandhā। (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21738.018149\">6:02:18</span>  **394.** abyākataṃ dhammaṃ sampayutto abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā – vipākābyākataṃ kiriyābyākataṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ sampayuttā tayo khandhā, tayo khandhe sampayutto eko khandho, dve khandhe sampayuttā dve khandhā; paṭisandhikkhaṇe vipākābyākataṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ sampayuttā tayo khandhā, tayo khandhe sampayutto eko khandho, dve khandhe sampayuttā dve khandhā। (saṃkhittaṃ।) (1)</p><p><br /></p><p> ### 1:paccayānulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>### 2:saṅkhyāvāro</p><p><br /></p><p>### suddhaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21790.444122\">6:03:10</span>  **395.** hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā tīṇi, anantare tīṇi, samanantare tīṇi, sahajāte tīṇi, aññamaññe tīṇi, nissaye tīṇi, upanissaye tīṇi, purejāte tīṇi, āsevane tīṇi, kamme tīṇi, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre tīṇi, indriye tīṇi, jhāne tīṇi, magge tīṇi, sampayutte tīṇi, vippayutte tīṇi, atthiyā tīṇi, natthiyā tīṇi, vigate tīṇi, avigate tīṇi।</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21834.234435\">6:03:54</span>  &gt; *anulomaṃ।*</p><p><br /></p><p>### 2:paccayapaccanīyaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p> ### 1:vibhaṅgavāro</p><p><br /></p><p>### nahetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21840.790201\">6:04:00</span> **396.** akusalaṃ dhammaṃ sampayutto akusalo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā – vicikicchāsahagate uddhaccasahagate khandhe sampayutto vicikicchāsahagato uddhaccasahagato moho। (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21861.313513\">6:04:21</span>  **397.** abyākataṃ dhammaṃ sampayutto abyākato dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā – ahetukaṃ vipākābyākataṃ kiriyābyākataṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ sampayuttā tayo khandhā, tayo khandhe sampayutto eko khandho, dve khandhe sampayuttā dve khandhā; ahetukapaṭisandhikkhaṇe vipākābyākataṃ ekaṃ khandhaṃ sampayuttā tayo khandhā, tayo khandhe sampayutto eko khandho, dve khandhe sampayuttā dve khandhā। (saṃkhittaṃ।) (1)</p><p><br /></p><p>### 2:paccayapaccanīyaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>### 2:saṅkhyāvāro</p><p><br /></p><p>### suddhaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21915.914713\">6:05:15</span> **398.** nahetuyā dve, naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, navippayutte tīṇi। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21938.759262\">6:05:38</span>  &gt; *paccanīyaṃ।*</p><p><br /></p><p>### 3:paccayānulomapaccanīyaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>### hetudukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21944.988746\">6:05:44</span>  **399.** hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, navippayutte tīṇi। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21966.522014\">6:06:06</span>  &gt; *anulomapaccanīyaṃ।*</p><p><br /></p><p>### 4:paccayapaccanīyānulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p> ### nahetudukaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"21974.021054\">6:06:14</span> **400.** nahetupaccayā ārammaṇe dve, anantare dve, samanantare dve, sahajāte dve, aññamaññe dve, nissaye dve, upanissaye dve, purejāte dve, āsevane dve, kamme dve, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre dve, indriye dve, jhāne dve, magge ekaṃ, sampayutte dve, vippayutte dve, atthiyā dve, natthiyā dve, vigate dve, avigate dve। (saṃkhittaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22013.308622\">6:06:53</span>  &gt; *paccanīyānulomaṃ।*</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22020.832747\">6:07:00</span>  &gt; *sampayuttavāro।*</p><p><br /></p><p>(saṃsaṭṭhattaṃ nāma sampayuttattaṃ, sampayuttattaṃ nāma saṃsaṭṭhattaṃ।)</p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p></p>","media-time":21.804479}